    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d526">

                <pb facs="0742" n="646" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg646"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-12-23"><hi rendition="#italic">December 23,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 98.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that, under date
                    of December 20, instant, I have replied to the note of the Spanish Government of
                    October 23 last, which note was in answer to my note of September 23 last. I
                    delivered this reply personally to Señor Gullon, the minister of foreign
                    affairs. Inclosed I hand you full copy of the text of my answer, and have the
                    honor to be,</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stewart L. Woodford.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d526-a1.xml" xpointer="d526-a1"/>
            </div>
